MAYA: That's panic with a spreadsheet. The whole semiconductor complex is getting destroyed because everyone's suddenly worried about supply chains and geopolitical blowback, and the only thing that wins in a crisis is the stuff that comes out of the ground. Coca-Cola is up two point nine five, Pepsi up one point seven seven—people aren't trading on fundamentals right now, they're trading on 'what do I need if the world gets weird?' And apparently the answer is sugar water and crude oil.

5
